<v Michael Lapaglia>No.
<v Michael Lapaglia>没有。

00:21:48.110 --> 00:21:53.350
<v Rebecca Allensworth>Dr. LaPaglia was like, yeah, I think we probably cut some corners. I think, you know, mistakes were made.
