00:21:53.350 --> 00:22:06.080
<v Michael Lapaglia>No, we discussed it, and we knew that what we were doing wasn't ideal because we had very little resources to get started. But we never imagined that we were breaking the law.
<v Michael Lapaglia>不，我们讨论过，我们知道我们做的事情并不理想，因为我们开始时几乎没有资源。但我们从未想过我们触犯了法律。

