00:22:30.780 --> 00:22:51.720
<v Dana Chivvis>I spoke with Dr. LaPaglia. He didn't want me to record our conversation. And we didn't talk for long before he got off the phone. But he reiterated to me that he and Dr. Brooks didn't think they were doing anything wrong. When they worked in addiction clinics, the doctors there would hand prescriptions to receptionists. And the receptionist would call them into a pharmacy. It happened all the time.
<v Dana Chivvis>我和拉帕利亚医生谈过。他不想让我录下我们的对话。我们在挂电话之前也没聊太久。但他向我重申，他和布鲁克斯医生并不认为他们做了什么错事。当他们在成瘾诊所工作时，那里的医生会把处方交给前台接待员。然后接待员会打电话给药房。这经常发生。

00:22:51.720 --> 00:23:12.340
<v Dana Chivvis>He told me, quote, "We did not see any difference between him giving me verbal authorization to call them in and verbal authorization to write a prescription. I still don't see a difference. And if someone had a problem with that, the federal government had a problem with that, they could have just told us to stop. They didn't have to indict us and charge us with two felonies."
<v Dana Chivvis>他告诉我，引用：“我们没觉得他给我口头授权打电话和口头授权写处方有什么区别。我至今没看出区别。如果有人对此有意见，联邦政府有意见，他们本可以告诉我们停止。他们不必起诉我们并指控我们犯有两项重罪。”

00:23:12.340 --> 00:23:32.800
<v Dana Chivvis>I reached out to Dr. LaPaglia several times after that initial call, but he declined my request to talk further. There were three board members hearing Dr. Brooks's case that day. And they were not swayed by this defense that they didn't know they were doing anything wrong, that they were just trying to help their drug-sick patients.
<v Dana Chivvis>在那次初步通话后，我多次联系拉帕利亚医生，但他拒绝了我进一步交谈的请求。那天有三名委员会成员听取了布鲁克斯医生的案件。他们并没有被这种“他们不知道自己在做错事，他们只是想帮助成瘾的病人”的辩解所动摇。

00:23:32.800 --> 00:23:43.870
<v Dana Chivvis>In fact, the board members suspected that L&B Healthcare was not a legitimate business at all. Here's Dr. Charles Handorf, one of the board members, questioning Dr. LaPaglia.
<v Dana Chivvis>事实上，委员会成员怀疑L&B医疗根本不是一个合法的业务。这是委员会成员查尔斯·汉多夫医生在质询拉帕利亚医生。

00:23:43.870 --> 00:23:48.650
<v Charles Handorf>Did the clinic ever apply for or receive a business license?
<v Charles Handorf>诊所有没有申请或收到营业执照？

