00:24:43.880 --> 00:24:59.870
<v Dana Chivvis>And here's what the deal was. Basically, LaPaglia could go back to practicing medicine in another month. But he'd be on probation for five years, and he'd have to be monitored by a physicians' addiction group. And he'd be banned from prescribing controlled substances for two years.
<v Dana Chivvis>交易是这样的。基本上，拉帕利亚可以在一个月后重返医疗岗位。但他将处于五年缓刑期，并且必须受到医生成瘾小组的监督。并且他将被禁止开具受控物质两年。

