00:26:04.490 --> 00:26:19.200
<v Consumer Member>This man doesn't need to be on the streets or in his office, writing prescriptions in the state of Tennessee, as far as I'm concerned. And we're charged with the responsibility of protecting the citizens of Tennessee, so that's my concern. So how do we get to that point?
<v Consumer Member>据我所知，这个人不应该出现在街头或他的办公室里，在田纳西州开处方。我们肩负着保护田纳西州公民的责任，所以这是我的担忧。那么我们如何走到那一步呢？

